529 0 obj
<< /ActualText (Your caravan solar system has 4 parts: solar panels\nmake power from sunlight, a battery stores it, a charge\ncontroller protects the battery from overcharging, and\nan inverter converts battery power to run your normal\nappliances. That's it.\n\nYou size the system based on how much power you use\nper day \(measured in watt-hours\). This guide tells you\nexactly what to buy for your usage level.) /K [ 7 ] /P 528 0 R /S /Span /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
530 0 obj
<< /K [ 8 531 0 R ] /P 42 0 R /S /P /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
531 0 obj
<< /ActualText (Here's what a caravan solar system does:) /K [ 9 ] /P 530 0 R /S /Span /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
