3176 0 obj
<< /ActualText (Without a monitor, you guess how much charge is left. You run it down\ntoo far, it wears out faster. A SmartShunt costs $130-$160.) /K [ 7 ] /P 3175 0 R /S /Span /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
3177 0 obj
<< /K [ 8 3178 0 R ] /P 88 0 R /S /P /Type /StructElem >>
